        <h2 id="story-heading" class="c-hero__title" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 4.25rem);">
          Not a<br>traditional<br>company<br>story.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div style="grid-column: span 5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;">
