          Some companies begin with a plan. <span class="u-text-clay">Ours began with curiosity, family, and the belief that the best work still feels personal.</span>
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
